    "detailed_description": "Fixer\u2019s Tale is an interactive work of art with a non-linear storyline. Explore the Scientific Research Facility, brimming with silly riddles, obvious dangers, clich\u00e9d dialogues, and minimalist design.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>Embark on a journey through five floors filled with:<br>- 10 quirky locations (mostly laboratories)<br>- 36,000 words of text (prepare for some serious reading)<br>- 2,000 containers for storing mysterious artefacts (all surprisingly identical)<br>- 17 types of chairs (specially curated for furniture enthusiasts)<br>- 1 lunch break (an unforgettable dining experience)<br>- Countless references and Easter eggs (not stolen, but inspired)<br><br>Multiple game endings, including secret ones. Navigate the game in several unique ways. Experience the dumbest intellectual test in history. All of this is Fixer\u2019s Tale. Good luck, repairman!",
    "about_the_game": "Fixer\u2019s Tale is an interactive work of art with a non-linear storyline. Explore the Scientific Research Facility, brimming with silly riddles, obvious dangers, clich\u00e9d dialogues, and minimalist design.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>Embark on a journey through five floors filled with:<br>- 10 quirky locations (mostly laboratories)<br>- 36,000 words of text (prepare for some serious reading)<br>- 2,000 containers for storing mysterious artefacts (all surprisingly identical)<br>- 17 types of chairs (specially curated for furniture enthusiasts)<br>- 1 lunch break (an unforgettable dining experience)<br>- Countless references and Easter eggs (not stolen, but inspired)<br><br>Multiple game endings, including secret ones. Navigate the game in several unique ways. Experience the dumbest intellectual test in history. All of this is Fixer\u2019s Tale. Good luck, repairman!",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the Scientific Research Facility &quot;Camelot-22&quot;. The emergency personnel replacement system has chosen you to address the next unusual contingency. Immerse yourself in the humorous tale of a repair job filled with laughter, silly dialogues, angry chairs, and dim-witted robots.",
